TAC GIA

Du an nay la ket qua cua HAI phan viec khac nhau, khong tach roi duoc.

  Y TUONG, BAI TOAN VA DINH HUONG  --  thienwu, nguoi VAN HANH may chu that

    Dat bai toan tu su co that tren may chu dang chay. Quyet dinh moi huong di
    lon - va quan trong hon, quyet dinh nhung huong KHONG duoc di:

      - cam huong 4096, kem luat tu kiem "no co can bigarray khong?"
      - cam dong vao ho phys / prop_physics
      - cam sua file BSP: chi duoc DOC de do
      - yeu cau CONG THUC CHUNG - phai ap dung cho MOI map ke ca map chua tung
        thay, va plugin phai TU KIEM luc chay, khong dung danh sach viet tay
      - canh bao truoc rang huong killent nguy hiem, dan thang toi viec tim ra
        lo hong VA CHAM ma bo dieu kien tu dong da bo sot hoan toan

    Chay thu, chup log, do tren may chu that, va BAC BO nhieu ket luan sai cua
    AI. Cac dong ghi "SAI, da sua" trong ma nguon la dau vet cua nhung lan do.

  DICH NGUOC, VIET MA, DO DAC, TAI LIEU  --  Claude (Anthropic), Claude Code

    Doc nguoc server.dll / engine.dll / client.dll, thiet ke va viet toan bo ma
    nguon, chay cac phep do, va viet moi tai lieu trong kho nay.

Noi ro cach chia nay vi hai ly do:
  1. Ai doc ma nen biet no den tu dau de tu quyet dinh muc do tin tuong.
  2. Nhieu ket luan rut ra tu doc nguoc nhi phan, khong phai tu tai lieu chinh
     thuc. Chung deu kem dia chi ham va doan lenh de kiem lai duoc. Cai gi khong
     xac minh duoc thi ghi thang la KHONG XAC DINH.


